<p class="legal-lead">This page explains which personal data the application processes and why.</p>
<h3>Data we store</h3><p>Your account (login, e-mail, password hash), optional two-factor secret and security-key credentials, the job offers, applications, contacts and enterprises you enter, and the documents you upload or generate (stored in your own private folder).</p>
<h3>Purpose</h3><p>Only to provide the job-search tracking features. Your data is not sold or used for advertising.</p>
<h3>Sharing</h3><p>Your data is not shared with third parties. Requests to external job sites only happen when you trigger an import or an external form.</p>
<h3>Security</h3><p>Access requires authentication; two-factor authentication and security keys are available in Settings.</p>
<h3>Your rights</h3><p>You may access, correct, export or delete your data at any time. Deleting your account also removes your offers and applications.</p>
<h3>Cookies</h3><p>Only the session cookie required for you to stay signed in is used.</p>
